# Continues the published route from walkthrough_01_mundania.xit.
include walkthrough_01_mundania.xit

# ============================================================
# Walkthrough, segment 2: the phone call from Edsel.
#
# The call is TIME-GATED. The phone is not ringing when you first reach the
# kitchen, and the game says so ("That might make sense if the phone were
# ringing."). Waiting with F1 advances the clock until it rings.
#
# Answering opens the conversation UI. Dialogue options are rows at
# y = 114, 123, 131, 139, 147, 156. The published path is "Hi, Edsel"
# (option 3 in the first menu) then 1, 2, 2, 3, which makes Edsel send the
# game by courier -- scored 15 points.
# ============================================================

key 0 59
run 30
move 275 32
run 4
click left
run 15
move 14 87
run 4
click left
run 40
checkpoint wt2_call_open

move 120 131
run 5
click left
run 40
checkpoint wt2_said_hi

move 120 114
run 5
click left
run 40
move 120 123
run 5
click left
run 40
move 120 123
run 5
click left
run 40
move 120 131
run 5
click left
run 60
checkpoint wt2_bet_accepted
shot build/frames/wt2_bet_accepted.bmp
